[{"title":"赠韩拙堂","author":"袁甫","text":"世所谓巧，请为翁说。\n巧于利口，佞辞河决。\n何如吉人，其言呐呐。\n巧于附势，炙手可热。\n何如节士，刚肠若铁。\n巧于营生，百计渔夺。\n何如儒家，冷淡生活。\n拙反为巧，巧乃大拙。\n蓦然猛省，比论未彻。\n本无巧拙，奚较优劣。\n大道融融，旷兮太空。\n恶不待攻，善与人同。\n客访拙翁，携酒相从。\n客去西东，翁数飞鸿。\n春日烘烘，适兴携筇。\n兴尽呼童，燕坐堂中。\n一门雍雍，兰玉玲珑。\n客贺拙翁，笑倚长松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59555,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题建宁南乡桥","author":"袁枢","text":"玉龙倒影卧寒潭，人在云霄天地宽。\n借问是谁题此柱，茂陵词客到长安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59556,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高宗皇帝挽词 其二","author":"袁枢","text":"历数钦尧命，讴歌乐舜归。\n玑衡新日月，黼黻旧裳衣。\n姑射游神远，崆峒探道微。\n龙髯攀莫及，空怅白云飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59557,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高宗皇帝挽词 其一","author":"袁枢","text":"云集燕城扰，龙翔汉业兴。\n风燃燎衣火，雪拥渡河冰。\n险难成戡定，忧劳付纂承。\n百年馀父老，呜咽望原陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59558,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷精舍十咏 其二 仁智堂","author":"袁枢","text":"此身本无累，动静随所寓。\n结庐在岩谷，自适山水趣。\n朝来挹云气，日夕沐风露。\n坐观天地心，讵忘仁智虑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59559,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷精舍十咏 其四 观善斋","author":"袁枢","text":"出处绍前哲，典型资后生。\n虚堂悬青镜，视者心自明。\n古人不难到，功用在力行。\n缅怀朋簪盍，耿耿中夜情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59560,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷精舍十咏 其八 钓矶","author":"袁枢","text":"投辖出东溟，持竿归九曲。\n溪翁来问讯，笑失双鬓绿。\n潭边旧钓石，瑩滑磨青玉。\n竟日谩垂纶，忘机看鸥浴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59561,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷精舍十咏 其九 茶灶","author":"袁枢","text":"摘茗蜕仙岩，汲水潜虬穴。\n旋然石上灶，轻汎瓯中雪。\n清风已生腋，芳味犹在舌。\n何时棹孤舟，来此分馀啜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59562,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷精舍十咏 其七 铁笛亭","author":"袁枢","text":"当年跨鹤翁，想在云深处。\n铁笛忽龙吟，万壑披霾雾。\n遥知发天秘，踏破苍苔路。\n吹与众仙闻，来看晚题句。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59563,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷精舍十咏 其六 晚对亭","author":"袁枢","text":"落日郁苍烟，空山转寒碧。\n石屏倚天立，端峭一千尺。\n无言独与对，足以永朝夕。\n何用向时流，抵掌恣谈剧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59564,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷精舍十咏 其十 渔艇","author":"袁枢","text":"溪回山路断，月白沙汀冷。\n有人掀短篷，击棹歌声永。\n闻之三叹息，涣然发深省。\n归去万石滩，理我钓鱼艇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59565,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷精舍十咏 其三 隐求室","author":"袁枢","text":"本是山中人，归来山中友。\n岂同荷蓧老，永结躬耕耦。\n浮云忽出岫，肤寸弥九有。\n此志未可量，见之千载后。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59566,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷精舍十咏 其一 隐屏精舍","author":"袁枢","text":"先生出云谷，看尽东南山。\n吴越几往来，衡庐屡跻攀。\n恨无璚瑶英，驻此冰雪颜。\n有怀武夷仙，相期苍翠间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59567,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷精舍十咏 其五 寒栖馆","author":"袁枢","text":"岩前风入松，谷口泉漱石。\n写之五弦琴，身在函丈席。\n竹间有馀地，营馆招羽客。\n静夜縆高弦，待月寒林隙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59568,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄朱晦翁山中丹砂","author":"袁枢","text":"丹砂九转世莫传，羽衣婀娜飞朝天。\n凄然风露洗尘世，星斗一天随转旋。\n空馀丹鼎在岩际，夜夜虹光腾霁烟。\n天遗紫阳弭绛节，点石成玉公须专。\n朝来金锁开洞府，丹火已灰当复然。\n离龙坎虎玄又玄，不须人间询谪仙。\n黄熊跑号青兕舞，争欲舐鼎严笞鞭。\n岩头风高捲衣袂，嘶断玉龙云满川。\n怡然上池漱琼液，鼓枻下濯丹溪泉。\n云间双鹤傥未下，招隐为我歌长篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59569,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题屏风","author":"袁枢","text":"泰山一毫轻，沧海一滴水。\n我观天地间，何啻犹一指。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59570,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"袁枢","text":"温黄前后并，殿下不须行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59571,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伤乱二首 其二","author":"袁玧","text":"轰轰烈烈一乾坤，北马南船日夜奔。\n野老有怀悲故国，孤臣无泪哭中原。\n浮生似我仍留寓，季世何人不闭门。\n独惜两湖归隐后，枕戈谁是晋刘琨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59572,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伤乱二首 其一","author":"袁玧","text":"龙蛇风浪起空潭，苍莽山河泣坠簪。\n乱向十年馀史笔，贫无一字到诗函。\n心惊塞马过淮北，梦逐关鸿度岭南。\n肉食何人司重鼎，等閒挥麈事清谭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59573,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"袁坰","text":"虽云误失风霜操，不替调羹为子贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59574,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昨暮侍玉霄亭坐新月初上凉风叠至配以丹荔白醑景物且美赋诗呈知府丈","author":"袁复一","text":"夜凉时到此亭中，舞袂掀髯几许同。\n竹叶旧曾浮大白，绛囊新喜擘轻红。\n若为遽舍风千叠，未苦能留月一弓。\n只尺玉峰应好在，欲招鸾驭下空濛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59575,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三学山","author":"袁彦安","text":"万松棹秀五弟柏，千劫栖贤三学山。\n佛定光生玉玺润，僧衣细结藕丝斑。\n归来鹦鹉扫白塔，声在翠微烟霭间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59576,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"袁思永","text":"万叠云山拥郡楼，凭栏下瞰卧龙湫。\n二年吏役何曾到，孤负清风月白秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59577,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈东坡","author":"袁点","text":"青盖美人回凤带，绣衣男子返云车。\n上天一笑浑无事，从此人间乐有馀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59578,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二十日新田清江一曲小饮","author":"袁说友","text":"一曲清江古岸头，茅檐初日照高秋。\n数声又得閒身到，相对绿漪横小舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59579,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"万元亨名所居为景马堂于其家求书记额","author":"袁说友","text":"公居虽未称潭潭，占尽湖山直到南。\n觅我新题留琬琰，少游高处要同谙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59580,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上元次日至黄州遇雨","author":"袁说友","text":"谁说黄州斗样微，满城灯火亦相辉。\n痴儿方有揶揄意，却得连江雨解围。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59581,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书魏元益便面","author":"袁说友","text":"闭门终老幽人事，负笈担簦学者宜。\n过我莫虚黄卷日，还乡须念锦衣时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59582,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王醇父统帅舫斋","author":"袁说友","text":"将军忠勇贯家声，独擅长江十万兵。\n早誓中流誇击楫，料公犹小舫斋名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59583,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"发山阳得顺风二首 其一","author":"袁说友","text":"晓入山阳古渡头，轻帆猎猎送行舟。\n风师怜我征程滞，顷刻扬舲到泗州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59584,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"叶信父家听琵琶","author":"袁说友","text":"娉婷未嫁惜琵琶，借与诗人著意誇。\n不数前人推引曲，只矜赵女绮罗花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59585,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用左康叔知府韵题龟溪左顾亭","author":"袁说友","text":"风下疏棂月下溪，愁边拓尽剖藩篱。\n平生漫说江湖客，未解人间手不龟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59586,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用杨诚斋韵再题欧阳长老墨梅 其三","author":"袁说友","text":"从来冰雪体，引墨为君开。\n寄语金鸾客，和羹人正来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59587,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用杨诚斋韵再题欧阳长老墨梅 其一","author":"袁说友","text":"红妆誇睡足，粉额趁颜开。\n惟有江梅样，蛾眉淡拂来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59588,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用杨诚斋韵再题欧阳长老墨梅 其二","author":"袁说友","text":"玉容曾浥麝，彷佛带香开。\n不比真花怯，斓斑怕雨来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59589,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用洪叔炳题左顾亭韵","author":"袁说友","text":"龟老一溪怀旧事，人亡千载尚虚名。\n亭前独有山川在，付与诗人著语明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59590,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用谢艮斋韵题欧阳长老墨梅 其一","author":"袁说友","text":"误墨虽藏白，飞埃欲敛昏。\n谁将草玄手，著意写前村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59591,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用谢艮斋韵题欧阳长老墨梅 其二","author":"袁说友","text":"屏灯红灼烁，窗月正黄昏。\n印出横斜影，分明竹外村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59592,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用谢艮斋韵题欧阳长老墨梅 其三","author":"袁说友","text":"溪藤横翠约，老眼颇眵昏。\n唤入凌烟后，江村不是村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59593,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白鹭洲","author":"袁说友","text":"可惜洲亭已渐荒，了无鸥鹭白双双。\n摩挲石上琳琅句，犹得斯文镇大江。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59594,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"先遗二子鱼于子长踰旬而子长以四子鱼来","author":"袁说友","text":"诗来愧我秕糠前，四尾堆盘胜酒船。\n席上已无弹铗恨，感恩何止二赢钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59595,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次交代韵四首 其一","author":"陈造","text":"笔力潜窥大小苏，诗传诸老定嚱吁。\n从今订价连城重，政使群儿有善诬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59596,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次交代韵四首 其二","author":"陈造","text":"昔夸石廪祝融堆，骤见人家画轴开。\n坐挹高寒吾愿足，此行似为此山来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59597,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再至左顾亭用前韵二首 其二","author":"袁说友","text":"晓日摇光下钓溪，鸣舷布网竹编篱。\n枯鱼泣与鲂鱼钓，要学亭前曳尾龟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59598,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再至左顾亭用前韵二首 其一","author":"袁说友","text":"春入桃花水涨溪，蔷薇隔屋粲成篱。\n湖山正为诗人好，早赋归欤要抵龟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59599,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冰解图","author":"袁说友","text":"游鱼岂解知人意，孝子精诚一念深。\n乐事世间如此少，我怀风木只伤心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59600,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吕公亭","author":"袁说友","text":"仙翁何地不翱翔，底事三游只岳阳。\n不是朗吟飞过疾，洞庭张乐要迎将。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59601,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感","author":"袁说友","text":"半生宦海几途穷，岁晚扁舟系此中。\n料得江神知我意，明朝好赠一帆风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59602,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江上度元宵节","author":"袁说友","text":"一舟元夕卧孤村，夜半相呼了不应。\n说与儿曹休谇语，黄州明日买残灯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59603,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江汉楼","author":"袁说友","text":"楼高百雉楚城东，吴蜀衣冠邂逅逢。\n自是荆山为屏翰，更看江汉日朝宗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59604,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江岸茅舍傍古梅奇甚携酒即之","author":"袁说友","text":"不为村深与水隈，也依篱落及时开。\n几年寂寞无人问，一日声名动客杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59605,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟行跨江之南北随流以行夜船多在淮西","author":"袁说友","text":"蜀道登天在一涯，乾旋坤转任推排。\n此身已是萍游客，终日行江夜宿淮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59606,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖","author":"袁说友","text":"西湖历历旧嬉游，佳处欣逢辄少留。\n却恨草堂元不识，故教俗眼为君羞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59607,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观盐井二首 其二","author":"袁说友","text":"私井公盐日夜煎，力劳功寡废民田。\n不如大噫驱东海，捲取洪波向蜀川。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59608,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观盐井二首 其一","author":"袁说友","text":"桔槔汲水三千丈，顷转轮馀一日回。\n蓑笠傍城埋井底，皮囊挈出卤泉来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59609,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过赤壁","author":"袁说友","text":"几年青史说周郎，赤壁乌林在武昌。\n明日有人山下过，一樽容我吊兴亡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59610,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过洞庭","author":"袁说友","text":"两湖绵亘连千里，万古苍梧说二妃。\n最羡巴童并蜀客，饱看日月去还归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59611,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过道人矶","author":"袁说友","text":"几年烟雨锁苍苔，咫尺侯门路不开。\n夜半一声横笛处，道人随月过山来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59612,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀借舟主人","author":"袁说友","text":"自怜五十鬓如丝，更把閒身与物驰。\n惟有高人收倦翼，世间万事一弹棋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59613,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李君量晋州奉诏还朝","author":"袁说友","text":"厌直承明两建牙，更将义槩浃朝家。\n举杯珍重吾归矣，林下需君步软沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59614,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李英才作墨梅于天庆观壁","author":"袁说友","text":"小折霜林半壁间，春风日日付毫端。\n秋高为借横斜影，留与吾师岁晚看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59615,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"求酒于邻","author":"袁说友","text":"太息官寒独养疴，浮生半作病维摩。\n新凉欲学东城醉，亡奈维罍已耻何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59616,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"求酒于周时仲教授","author":"袁说友","text":"寒窗矻矻数更声，灯火无多独自亲。\n忽报周郎好消息，明朝应遣白衣人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59617,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汨罗","author":"袁说友","text":"怀沙元不为谗嚣，要与江山作美谣。\n千载孤忠动神物，三湖今向汨罗朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59618,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"祀江神","author":"袁说友","text":"古庙阴阴不记年，扬帆逆浪几舟船。\n我舟小泊沙洲下，也谂江神问济川。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59619,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈氏子读书堂","author":"袁说友","text":"为公相与年犹小，拾芥明经意转非。\n惟有城南贤父子，读书元只为传衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59620,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"饮归","author":"袁说友","text":"醉饮寒窗惯击鲜，扶头岌岌似乘船。\n赓酬磊落成佳致，糠秕谁令辄在前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59621,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"到房交代招饮四首 其四","author":"陈造","text":"妓围檐额润空青，岫幌云关夜不扃。\n吏隐风流输我辈，可须逋客诧山灵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59622,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和九日南坡小集","author":"虞俦","text":"风雨年时政不佳，山翁无酒向谁赊。\n又还九日看黄菊，却喜晴天映碧纱。\n有底尊前悲节物，只应醉里送生涯。\n明年遍插茱萸处，目断西飞雁影斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59623,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呵笔 其二","author":"袁说友","text":"欲放酒肠愁酒病，强投诗社阙诗声。\n浮生失意每如此，薄命何人详细评。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59624,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呵笔 其一","author":"袁说友","text":"呵笔小吟消白日，闭门高卧却红尘。\n平生笑我千方误，投老从公两岁邻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59625,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和丁端叔书怀韵二首 其二","author":"袁说友","text":"春江稳去趣东归，折尽亭前杨柳丝。\n我欲吴江办投劾，与君花下说襟期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59626,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和丁端叔书怀韵二首 其一","author":"袁说友","text":"养花藏日半笼晴，尚有娇红照眼明。\n却恨中年怕离别，好诗撩动故乡情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59627,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和丁端叔双清韵","author":"袁说友","text":"翠云白雪两仙容，未怯姮娥傍月宫。\n若把佳人较清绝，争妍应愧伯夷风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":59628,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]